cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it using the metadata below."
title: "stkcraft-time: NAIF/SPICE-aligned astronomical time scales in Rust"
abstract: >-
  A Rust implementation of the NAIF/SPICE time-scale model.
  It converts UTC, TAI, TT, TDB/ET, GPS, UT1, TCG and TCB, reads
  leap-second (LSK), spacecraft clock (SCLK) and IERS EOP data, supports
  no_std with alloc, and includes an optional stdio MCP server.
authors:
  - name: "STKCraft"
    website: "https://www.stkcraft.com"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/spacelibres/STKCraft-time"
url: "https://www.stkcraft.com"
version: "0.1.23"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
keywords:
  - rust
  - astronomy
  - spice
  - naif
  - time
